     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.Number of cross-institutional coordination mechanisms established to facilitate adoption of relevant cybersecurity legislative and strategic documents.
2.Number of advocating initiatives implemented by the project to foster adoption of legislative and policy frameworks for resilient cybersecurity agenda in Bosnia and Herzegovina
3.Number of the infrastructure and facilities for establishment of CERT.
4.Number of IT government staff (male/female) receiving specialized training and certification programs on digital content and privacy in a systemic manner.
5.Number of regional and in-country knowledge sharing, and best-practice exchange initiatives undertaken in cooperation with relevant government institutions and academia to facilitate a more coherent approach to cybersecurity.
6.Number of awareness raising interventions supported by the project with an aim to inform and educate relevant individuals government representatives regarding cybersecurity risk and negative impacts on people.</narrative>
    </description>
